<title>SOUTH KOREA: LG wins $50 mln Syrian colour TV deal.</title>
<headline>LG wins $50 mln Syrian colour TV deal.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's LG Electronics Inc said on Wednesday it won a $50 million order to sell 30,000 colour televisions to Syrian Arab Co for Electronic Industry.</p>
<p>LG, a unit of LG Group, said in a statement the televisions would be delivered over the next two years from early this year. -- Seoul Newroom (822) 727 5643</p>
</text>
